{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">An adventure calls. The Hero answers.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A foreboding new chapter unfolds in this massive content update, plunging you deeper into a realm of darkness, ruin, and ancient power. Two cursed lands now beckon\u2014their zones thick with malice and their guardians twisted beyond recognition. Only the strong will survive what lies ahead.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729840/extras/849506695c22cb0b51581c4f10cc8d59.poster.avif?t=1753981931\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729840/extras/849506695c22cb0b51581c4f10cc8d59.webm?t=1753981931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729840/extras/849506695c22cb0b51581c4f10cc8d59.mp4?t=1753981931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Brace yourself for a brutal reckoning:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two New Levels, Each Ending in a Boss Battle Tread cursed ground where the air hangs heavy with dread. At each journey\u2019s end waits an ancient horror\u2014merciless, cunning, and hungry for your final breath.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729840/extras/62c1b07322bb8a33c47759fb558d9a86.poster.avif?t=1753981931\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729840/extras/62c1b07322bb8a33c47759fb558d9a86.webm?t=1753981931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729840/extras/62c1b07322bb8a33c47759fb558d9a86.mp4?t=1753981931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Four New Weapon Types Discover armaments forged in shadow: weapons that break your foes in ways unseen before. Each brings new depth to your arsenal\u2014and new choices in how you deal death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Four New Shields Stand firm against the enemy. These relics of a fallen age offer unique defensive abilities, letting you endure even the most unholy assaults.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729840/extras/0d5dba07d4793f4ddc3c35650248a453.poster.avif?t=1753981931\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729840/extras/0d5dba07d4793f4ddc3c35650248a453.webm?t=1753981931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729840/extras/0d5dba07d4793f4ddc3c35650248a453.mp4?t=1753981931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Six New Enemy Types Grotesque abominations now stalk the land\u2014creatures molded by cruelty and bound to forgotten oaths. Each enemy brings new horrors, new attacks, and new ways to end you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three New Armor Sets Wear the armors of legends now fallen. These new sets not only alter your fate in combat, but transform your presence on the battlefield into something feared.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729840/extras/f8131b523b36bd3bcc564d27687a4814.poster.avif?t=1753981931\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729840/extras/f8131b523b36bd3bcc564d27687a4814.webm?t=1753981931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729840/extras/f8131b523b36bd3bcc564d27687a4814.mp4?t=1753981931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></vi